 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "This welder spent all night building walls inside an empty fuel tank.",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 3.193
  },
  {
   "text": "Five of them,",
   "s": 3.477,
   "e": 4.065
  },
  {
   "text": "each with a big round hole in the middle.",
   "s": 4.206,
   "e": 5.804
  },
  {
   "text": "His boss nearly fainted.",
   "s": 6.154,
   "e": 7.26
  },
  {
   "text": "Every wall stole space,",
   "s": 7.504,
   "e": 8.85
  },
  {
   "text": "and every gallon of space was money he would never haul.",
   "s": 9.011,
   "e": 11.384
  },
  {
   "text": "Down the road, a rival driver did the opposite:",
   "s": 11.964,
   "e": 14.073
  },
  {
   "text": "a tank with nothing inside but fuel.",
   "s": 14.33,
   "e": 16.027
  },
  {
   "text": "More gallons,",
   "s": 16.295,
   "e": 16.988
  },
  {
   "text": "more cash.",
   "s": 17.157,
   "e": 17.791
  },
  {
   "text": "By winter,",
   "s": 18.219,
   "e": 18.709
  },
  {
   "text": "he was buying lunch for the whole truck stop.",
   "s": 18.895,
   "e": 20.798
  },
  {
   "text": "Then came the mountain pass,",
   "s": 21.328,
   "e": 22.549
  },
  {
   "text": "covered in ice.",
   "s": 22.747,
   "e": 23.493
  },
  {
   "text": "Both drivers spotted a rock slide ahead and slammed the brakes.",
   "s": 23.879,
   "e": 26.783
  },
  {
   "text": "The welder's truck groaned,",
   "s": 27.187,
   "e": 28.328
  },
  {
   "text": "and stopped.",
   "s": 28.482,
   "e": 28.993
  },
  {
   "text": "The smooth truck kept going...",
   "s": 29.35,
   "e": 30.671
  },
  {
   "text": "sliding...",
   "s": 30.964,
   "e": 31.458
  },
  {
   "text": "until its bumper hung over the cliff.",
   "s": 31.797,
   "e": 33.48
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "s": 33.94,
   "e": 34.291
  },
  {
   "text": "a full tanker carries about twenty-five tons of fuel.",
   "s": 34.463,
   "e": 37.111
  },
  {
   "text": "When the truck stops,",
   "s": 37.47,
   "e": 38.37
  },
  {
   "text": "the fuel doesn't.",
   "s": 38.598,
   "e": 39.307
  },
  {
   "text": "In a smooth tank,",
   "s": 39.792,
   "e": 40.633
  },
  {
   "text": "it rushes forward in one giant wave and shoves the whole truck ahead.",
   "s": 40.86,
   "e": 44.13
  },
  {
   "text": "The walls break that wave into tiny splashes,",
   "s": 44.418,
   "e": 46.591
  },
  {
   "text": "so the fuel has nothing to push with.",
   "s": 46.736,
   "e": 48.254
  },
  {
   "text": "Next spring,",
   "s": 48.673,
   "e": 49.237
  },
  {
   "text": "the rival paid the welder to fill his tank with walls.",
   "s": 49.438,
   "e": 51.872
  }
 ]
